{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587490/extras/852313a8eca246c6e2776137b2dbfc3a.avif?t=1765560582\" width=630 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrors to Unveil is a series-based psychological horror game that immerses players in disturbing stories, each one unraveling the terrifying stories of those who lived to tell their experiences.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is the second episode in the series:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587490/extras/651a261eb1cdfa95b9aa632220d18b99.poster.avif?t=1765560582\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587490/extras/651a261eb1cdfa95b9aa632220d18b99.webm?t=1765560582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587490/extras/651a261eb1cdfa95b9aa632220d18b99.mp4?t=1765560582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Episode 2:\u00a0</strong>Terrors to Unveil - Day Off</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're Jack Williams, a 26-year-old hard worker who after several days of work managed to get a day off. Without thinking about it, you decide to spend your weekend at your cottage in the woods with your dog as your sole companion. But you didn't know what your stay there would involve.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily a first-person narrative walking simulator with exploration, and conversation mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment and photo-realistic graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS film aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player voice activity.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You have survived","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3587490/91459cf6f8dbe149ba2eeca1a8647fc897a18167.jpg"},{"name":"Curiosity Killed the Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3587490/7f33c1b4e86c591e8694268a308eb31ec4137763.jpg"},{"name":"Unveiled the Truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3587490/e971941683c782e5963add7e4edf73da5d0764b2.jpg"},{"name":"Employee of the Month","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3587490/76feeb19911f23a4fc709d58f9ec0053c86b0ccc.jpg"},{"name":"You Got a Gift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3587490/10c1065d918d97a697c08c5ca2b5923084d9bb54.jpg"},{"name":"New Encounters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3587490/8fac5ee4fbde802003ce6737f33ee865f9655796.jpg"},{"name":"Casual Clicks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3587490/179192a1aeffd9081ff6db3e2b17d0bd7b64d1ed.jpg"},{"name":"Game Over","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3587490/1f50a0ed729457c367556e84b5e4da640bd8dca5.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587490?t=1765560582","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587490?t=1765560582","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587490/ccdb9490b15918d043ea5af13b93a3fc09fcb53e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765560582","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app